### Data & Attribution Notice

The software source code in this repository is licensed under the MIT License.
Quranic Arabic text, morphology annotations, multilingual translations, tafsir,
and audio recitations are community and public scholarly resources sourced with
gratitude from:
- **Tanzil Project** (https://tanzil.net) — Verified Uthmani text
- **Quranic Arabic Corpus** (https://corpus.quran.com) — Morphological annotations
- **EveryAyah.com** (https://everyayah.com) — Audio recitations
- **Kementerian Agama RI & Basmeih** — Official translations
